OpenConvert's page segmentation (crates/oc-layout: Docstrum clustering, the whitespace-rectangle
cover, XY-cut, nearest-neighbour word extraction and reading-order detection) follows the
published algorithms as PdfPig implements them and takes some of PdfPig's default parameters.
No PdfPig code is linked or shipped.

Binary distributions of OpenConvert also contain:
  - PDFium (BSD-3-Clause), as built by bblanchon/pdfium-binaries; licence in licenses/pdfium.LICENSE.txt
  - llama.cpp's llama-server and its libraries (MIT); licence in licenses/llama.cpp.LICENSE.txt
  - the Rust crates listed, with their licence texts, in licenses/third-party-rust.txt
  - the user interface's third-party code, whose notices the app shows under Settings, About, Licenses
